00:30:58.610 --> 00:31:01.260
There's also two
upcoming books about SRE

00:31:01.260 --> 00:31:03.570
also being published
by O'Reilly--

00:31:03.570 --> 00:31:08.100
namely, the "Site Reliability
Workbook" and "Seeking SRE."

00:31:08.100 --> 00:31:10.939
One of those is written
and compiled by Google.

00:31:10.939 --> 00:31:12.480
The other one is
written and compiled

00:31:12.480 --> 00:31:16.890
