now works at Microsoft.

00:31:16.890 --> 00:31:21.290
And we also have the
Google.com/SRE website,

00:31:21.290 --> 00:31:22.944
in which you can go read more.

00:31:22.944 --> 00:31:23.860
MELANIE WARRICK: Nice.

00:31:23.860 --> 00:31:24.840
And I was going
say, I know we also

00:31:24.840 --> 00:31:27.510
