touches a little bit on SRE

00:31:27.510 --> 00:31:28.290
and DevOps--

00:31:28.290 --> 00:31:30.367
that has season 1.

00:31:30.367 --> 00:31:31.950
And anything else
that you guys wanted

00:31:31.950 --> 00:31:34.410
to talk about in
terms of SRE/DevOps

00:31:34.410 --> 00:31:35.490
that we haven't covered?

00:31:35.490 --> 00:31:36.390
SETH VARGO: You know,
Liz and I are always

00:31:36.390 --> 00:31:38.473
