00:32:27.060 --> 00:32:29.310
a researcher at a
regionally accredited

00:32:29.310 --> 00:32:30.720
academic institution.

00:32:30.720 --> 00:32:32.330
And in an ideal
world, I would need

00:32:32.330 --> 00:32:33.630
